Cutscene: {
	Erhan: {
		HandOfJudgement1: I ne'er meant'eth for that to be taken'eth literally??
		HandOfJudgement2: Thou arest not one in the position to smack'eth MINE buttocks with the Hand of Judgement!
	}

	Janitor: {
		GoodSamaritan: {
			Default: Keep up the good work, kid!
			Invisible: Am I seeing things? Or did that patch of goop just vanish?
		}

		Trolled: {
			GoodRoute: Ha, ha. Very funny. Now please clean that up...
			BadRoute: Hey! I just cleaned that spot up!
			Android: Hey, watch where you're stepping! You're giving me more gunk to clean!
			Janitor: Hey! Us janitors FIGHT grime, not SPREAD it! Clean that up!
			Invisible: Hey... how did that get there? I thought I cleaned that spot up!
			Default: Hey! Not cool!
		}

		Fakeout: {
			GoodRoute: Hey, what was that for? You just cleaned that up!
			BadRoute: Not funny. Clean that up, right now.
			Android: Why'd ya place that goop down again? There something wrong with your code?
			Janitor: Is this some kinda joke? You know you can get fired for stuff like this...
			Invisible: The goop has reappeared. Odd...
		}

		Apology: {
			GoodRoute: Thank you for listening to me. Now don't do that again.
			BadRoute: That's better... now don't do that again!
			Android: Good to see you're still functional enough to clean up after yourself...
			Janitor: What were you thinking? Please don't do that again!
			Invisible: And now the sludge is gone. Coulda sworn I cleaned it earlier...
		}

		Betrayal: {
			GoodRoute: ...the hell is wrong with you?
			BadRoute: WHAT DID I JUST SAY?!? Git outta here, ya scoundrel!
			Android: Okay, there's DEFINITELY something wrong with you. Tell Girus to fix you up, cause I ain't dealing with you no more!
			Janitor: What the hell?! If I had any administrative power, I'd fire you on the spot! Now scram!
			Invisible: AND NOW IT'S BACK AGAIN?? Am I on crazy pills??
		}
	}
}

